<title>USA: GOLF-MEMBERS OF U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MEMBERS OF U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM.</headline>
<dateline>MAMARONECK, New York 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10 members of the U.S. Ryder Cup team who earned automatic places on points Sunday (U.S. captain Tom Kite will round out the 12-man team with two selections to be announced Monday morning):</p>
<p> Tiger Woods	    1,185 points</p>
<p> Justin Leonard	 1,068</p>
<p> Tom Lehman	     1,022</p>
<p> Davis Love		 957</p>
<p> Jim Furyk		  947</p>
<p> Phil Mickelson	   809</p>
<p> Jeff Maggert	     806</p>
<p> Mark O'Meara	     801</p>
<p> Scott Hoch		 791</p>
<p> Brad Faxon		 727</p>
<p>(Tommy Tolles finished 11th at 689)</p>
</text>
